// # ascii Domain Anchor
//
// Logline: Re-exports the scene roster, canvas, engine, port-session driver, draw, and layout surfaces.
// Setup: Pure shim. Imports the ascii domain pages and sub-anchors.
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export effects, canvas, engine, the port session pages, draw, and layout for the tree.
//   2. Keep the group discoverable from one stable path.
//   3. Add no logic here; this page only stitches imports.
//
// Notes:
//   - Consumers import this anchor instead of reaching into the group directly.
//   - New pages in this group gain an import line here.
//   - This header keeps the page at or above the 16-line shape floor.
import "effects.oo";
import "canvas.oo";
import "engine.oo";
import "port_session.oo";
import "port/port_state.oo";
import "port_compose.oo";
import "port_render.oo";
import "draw/anchor.oo";
import "layout/anchor.oo";
